Error [jet.MissingTargetCapability]: Target `board.sensor_v1` lacks the required `Time.Wall` capability.
  --> tests/ui/target_missing_capability_e3311.jet:8:13
    |
  8 |     _: time.now()
    |             ^^^
 Why: The selected target profile must state each machine service separately; a target triple cannot imply a UART, clock, entropy source, scheduler, allocator, startup provider, or MMIO device.
 Fix: Select a typed target profile with a `Time.Wall` provider, or remove the reachable operation.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E3311
